                      "items": [
                        {
                          "q": "How do I find out what my truck is worth?",
                          "a": "Submit the valuation form with your truck’s year, make, model, mileage and condition. A team member reviews the details and contacts you. A final figure may depend on an in-person inspection."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What types of trucks can I sell?",
                          "a": "Tell us about your truck in the form, including Freightliner, Western Star, Autocar or other makes. Our team confirms which trucks we can purchase when they follow up."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "What information do I need to provide?",
                          "a": "The VIN, year, make, model, mileage and overall condition help most. Photos and notes about recent service or known issues are also useful."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Can I trade in my truck toward another one?",
                          "a": "Yes. Mention in the notes field that you are interested in a trade-in, and a team member can discuss it alongside new or used truck inventory and financing options."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Do I have to bring my truck to a dealership?",
                          "a": "The form is the first step. Whether an inspection is needed, and where it takes place, is discussed when a team member contacts you."
                        },
                        {
                          "q": "Which areas do you serve?",
                          "a": "Truck Country / Stoops operates dealerships in Iowa, Illinois, Indiana, Michigan, Ohio and Wisconsin. See the locations page to find the one nearest you."
                        }
